# Normalise to LF in the repository AND in the working tree on every platform.
#
# `text=auto` alone leaves Windows checkouts as CRLF (core.autocrlf=true),
# which Prettier then rejects on every single line — thousands of phantom
# "Delete ␍" errors after any branch switch. `eol=lf` pins the working tree to
# match what Prettier writes, so the two stop fighting.
* text=auto eol=lf
